WEBVTT

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:00.697
which may not work for this disease,

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:05.030
then you're actually
not giving yourself a fair chance

00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:08.397
to deal with the disease
in a more optimal way.

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:12.697
In India, I think we have
an excellent medical community,

00:09:12.697 --> 00:09:14.297
we have great doctors.

00:09:14.297 --> 00:09:17.497
And these doctors
were actually willing to experiment

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:20.963
with anything that could save patients.

00:09:20.997 --> 00:09:27.097
And what I mean by that is
way before WHO prescribed steroids

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:32.863
as one of the important interventions
for hyper immune responses,